  {
   "id": "cost",
   "name": "What one signed letter costs. And what a dead one wastes.",
   "items": [
    {
     "key": "cost.1",
     "kind": "Small label",
     "text": "What one deal costs to originate"
    },
    {
     "key": "cost.2",
     "kind": "Section headline",
     "text": "What one signed letter costs. <em>And what a dead one wastes.</em>"
    },
    {
     "key": "cost.3",
     "kind": "Paragraph",
     "text": "The published figures below are the starting values. Change any of them to your own and the totals follow. Nothing you enter is sent anywhere."
    },
    {
     "key": "cost.4",
     "kind": "Text",
     "text": "Associate, full time"
    },
    {
     "key": "cost.5",
     "kind": "Paragraph",
     "text": "Mapping, outreach, qualifying. The person is $135,000 to $253,000 in total compensation, and cannot run a process at the same time."
    },
    {
     "key": "cost.6",
     "kind": "Text",
     "text": "12–18"
    },
    {
     "key": "cost.7",
     "kind": "Text",
     "text": "Months to vertical depth"
    },
    {
     "key": "cost.8",
     "kind": "Paragraph",
     "text": "How long before a new hire knows which names are unbuyable and why, rather than adding them to the list again."
    },
    {
     "key": "cost.9",
     "kind": "Text",
     "text": "37–159"
    },
    {
     "key": "cost.10",
     "kind": "Text",
     "text": "Days under exclusivity per dead deal"
    },
    {
     "key": "cost.11",
     "kind": "Paragraph",
     "text": "The average by buyer type, from a family office to a senior lender, plus the diligence invoices already committed."
    },
    {
     "key": "cost.12",
     "kind": "Text",
     "text": "Retained search, one sector"
    },
    {
     "key": "cost.13",
     "kind": "Paragraph",
     "text": "Exclusive to you in that sector. The vertical already mapped, and the diligence view attached before the name reaches you. Scope and fee are agreed in writing."
    },
    {
     "key": "cost.14",
     "kind": "Form label",
     "text": "Associate total compensation, a year <i>($)</i>"
    },
    {
     "key": "cost.15",
     "kind": "Text",
     "text": "Midpoint of the published $135,000 to $253,000."
    },
    {
     "key": "cost.16",
     "kind": "Form label",
     "text": "Months of that person’s time per signed letter"
    },
    {
     "key": "cost.17",
     "kind": "Text",
     "text": "Your own figure. Twelve is a placeholder, not a measurement."
    },
    {
     "key": "cost.18",
     "kind": "Form label",
     "text": "Days under exclusivity before a letter dies"
    },
    {
     "key": "cost.19",
     "kind": "Text",
     "text": "Midpoint of the published 37 to 159, by buyer type."
    },
    {
