     "key": "cost.32",
     "kind": "Note",
     "text": "Compensation range compiled by a sell-side advisory firm from Glassdoor data, August 2024, for a US M&A associate, total compensation. Days under exclusivity from a lower-middle-market deal platform’s study of broken letters of intent, January 2026, averages by buyer type: 37 days where a family office was the buyer, 159 where a senior lender was. The months per letter and the count of dead letters are yours; the calculator does not supply them. Diligence invoices, legal fees and the time of anyone other than the associate are not included."
